Carpenter Blocks Revived
A port of Carpenter's Blocks to Minecraft 1.21.1 for Fabric and NeoForge.

This is a modified version of Carpenter's Blocks:
  - Original mod by Mineshopper and contributors: https://github.com/Mineshopper/carpentersblocks
  - 1.7.10 fork maintained by GTNewHorizons and contributors: https://github.com/GTNewHorizons/CarpentersBlocks
    (the port follows this fork, at commit 0ef22db308928e53fb67bccb5647af7d5e744556)

Changes: rewritten for Minecraft 1.21.1, Fabric and NeoForge, from 2026 by Scwunge. The code was ported to the
modern game; the textures, sounds and translations come from the original, some reorganized or adapted. The
differences in behavior are listed in docs/DEVIATIONS.md in the source code.

